      "Section": "ProductCategory",
      "Anchor": "productcategory",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The ProductCategory Taxonomy Versions - Standardized Data API provides standardized productCategory data across the LinkedIn platform. The API offers a collection of standardized productCatories.\nThis API doesn\u2019t share member personal data as part of the API response.",
